1
00:00:00,813 --> 00:00:02,943
(Year 2016)

2
00:00:03,013 --> 00:00:04,783
(Mirae District Art Competition Awards Ceremony)

3
00:00:06,213 --> 00:00:10,953
We will now begin the art competition awards ceremony.

4
00:00:11,423 --> 00:00:14,293
(Ko Eun Seol, Kang Hae Ra)

5
00:00:19,093 --> 00:00:22,263
(Cha Seok Jin)

6
00:00:22,293 --> 00:00:23,433
Ko Eun Seol.

7
00:00:23,863 --> 00:00:26,733
This student, for winning the Gold Prize...

8
00:00:27,003 --> 00:00:28,703
in the art competition hosted by the Mirae District Office,

9
00:00:28,803 --> 00:00:30,543
is hereby presented with this award.

10
00:00:31,673 --> 00:00:33,573
Next is the Grand Prize winner.

11
00:00:34,113 --> 00:00:35,213
Kang Hae Ra.

12
00:00:35,913 --> 00:00:39,083
This student, for winning the prestigious Grand Prize...

13
00:00:39,383 --> 00:00:41,883
in the art competition hosted by the Mirae District Office,

14
00:00:42,013 --> 00:00:43,623
is hereby presented with this award.

15
00:00:43,683 --> 00:00:46,253
(Mirae District Art Competition Awards Ceremony)

16
00:00:51,123 --> 00:00:53,363
(Mirae District Art Competition Awards Ceremony)

17
00:00:53,433 --> 00:00:57,003
Let's have a round of applause for all our winners.

18
00:01:09,613 --> 00:01:11,013
(Episode 1)

19
00:01:11,543 --> 00:01:13,383
Congratulations on winning the Grand Prize.

20
00:01:16,483 --> 00:01:17,553
Yours was pretty good, too.

21
00:01:20,723 --> 00:01:22,723
So, where do you take classes?

22
00:01:23,163 --> 00:01:24,163
Classes?

23
00:01:24,963 --> 00:01:27,193
Art classes. Which studio?

24
00:01:27,933 --> 00:01:29,193
I don't take any.

25
00:01:29,763 --> 00:01:30,763
No way.

26
00:01:32,263 --> 00:01:33,833
Do you have connections or something?

27
00:01:34,003 --> 00:01:35,003
What's that supposed to mean?

28
00:01:35,073 --> 00:01:36,073
I mean, think about it.

29
00:01:36,603 --> 00:01:39,203
How did you win the Gold Prize when you don't even take classes?

30
00:01:41,313 --> 00:01:43,543
Did you win the Grand Prize because you go to a top-tier studio?

31
00:01:44,083 --> 00:01:45,083
What?

32
00:01:45,413 --> 00:01:47,653
That's what you're implying, isn't it?

33
00:01:47,813 --> 00:01:49,013
Hey, Ko Eun Seol.

34
00:01:49,113 --> 00:01:51,983
But I know that's not it. I liked your painting.

35
00:01:52,523 --> 00:01:53,993
I think you deserved the Grand Prize.

36
00:01:54,423 --> 00:01:56,123
That's why I really meant it when I congratulated you.

37
00:02:00,833 --> 00:02:01,893
That little...

38
00:02:24,553 --> 00:02:26,383
Are you the girl in the painting?

39
00:02:27,193 --> 00:02:28,223
What?

40
00:02:28,523 --> 00:02:30,193
I'm asking if you painted this.

41
00:02:32,793 --> 00:02:34,733
Yes, I did. Why?

42
00:02:35,463 --> 00:02:36,703
You're Ko Eun Seol, right?

43
00:02:39,533 --> 00:02:40,673
I'm Cha Seok Jin, a senior.

44
00:02:41,933 --> 00:02:44,503
I know. Of course. You're a legend at our school.

45
00:02:44,803 --> 00:02:45,803
A legend? Hardly.

46
00:02:46,673 --> 00:02:47,673
Anyway...

47
00:02:49,173 --> 00:02:50,343
Will you sell me this painting?

48
00:02:51,613 --> 00:02:52,613
What?

49
00:02:54,113 --> 00:02:56,883
I'm saying I'll buy this painting.

50
00:02:58,583 --> 00:02:59,583
How much do you want for it?

51
00:03:02,053 --> 00:03:04,923
I've never thought about it.

52
00:03:04,993 --> 00:03:06,023
Then give it some thought,

53
00:03:06,963 --> 00:03:08,233
because I really want this piece.

54
00:03:11,563 --> 00:03:12,563
Seok Jin.

55
00:03:13,603 --> 00:03:14,603
Hey.

56
00:03:15,273 --> 00:03:17,403
I'm having a party at my house this weekend.

57
00:03:17,703 --> 00:03:18,703
You're coming, right?

58
00:03:18,973 --> 00:03:20,213
A party? What for?

59
00:03:20,513 --> 00:03:21,573
What else?

60
00:03:22,513 --> 00:03:23,513
I won the Grand Prize, remember?

61
00:03:24,913 --> 00:03:26,853
- You're coming, right? - I don't know.

62
00:03:28,983 --> 00:03:29,983
Are you going too?

63
00:03:30,883 --> 00:03:33,693
What? No, I...

64
00:03:34,293 --> 00:03:35,823
You should be there. You won an award too.

65
00:03:36,323 --> 00:03:37,323
Can she come too?

66
00:03:38,523 --> 00:03:40,333
- Her too? - Is that a no?

67
00:03:41,933 --> 00:03:42,933
Fine. Whatever.

68
00:03:45,763 --> 00:03:46,803
Let's go to the snack bar.

69
00:03:47,303 --> 00:03:48,303
Sure.

70
00:04:16,963 --> 00:04:17,963
Wait.

71
00:04:18,333 --> 00:04:19,333
Yes?

72
00:04:20,203 --> 00:04:22,473
Don't put the tables so close together.

73
00:04:23,033 --> 00:04:24,403
It'll be uncomfortable for the guests.

74
00:04:26,773 --> 00:04:27,773
You.

75
00:04:28,773 --> 00:04:29,943
Don't put the cheese there.

76
00:04:30,483 --> 00:04:32,743
- The sun will hit that spot soon. - Yes, ma'am.

77
00:04:41,593 --> 00:04:42,593
Are you all set?

78
00:04:42,993 --> 00:04:45,263
Manager Joo, which one looks better?

79
00:04:45,463 --> 00:04:48,433
A shorter dress is better than a long one on the grass.

80
00:04:48,633 --> 00:04:49,833
It makes your movements look graceful,

81
00:04:49,893 --> 00:04:50,903
and you'll look more lively.

82
00:04:51,133 --> 00:04:53,063
Right? I thought so too.

83
00:04:55,003 --> 00:04:56,473
The hard work paid off.

84
00:04:56,703 --> 00:04:58,243
I didn't expect you to win the grand prize.

85
00:04:58,403 --> 00:04:59,473
What are you talking about?

86
00:04:59,543 --> 00:05:01,843
It wasn't easy to get that painting.

87
00:05:02,573 --> 00:05:04,313
The artist changed their mind at the last minute,

88
00:05:04,513 --> 00:05:05,983
and I had a hard time convincing them.

89
00:05:06,043 --> 00:05:07,113
Are you seeking credit?

90
00:05:07,713 --> 00:05:09,253
Aren't artists a dime a dozen?

91
00:05:09,713 --> 00:05:11,823
- Hae Ra... - Besides, what good is it...

92
00:05:11,853 --> 00:05:13,323
if no one wants to buy it?

93
00:05:14,623 --> 00:05:15,653
What are you still doing here?

94
00:05:16,093 --> 00:05:17,363
Then get changed and come out.

95
00:05:39,583 --> 00:05:40,653
Hey, you made it.

96
00:05:42,753 --> 00:05:43,983
What are you doing standing outside?

97
00:05:44,623 --> 00:05:45,623
Let's go in.

98
00:05:48,223 --> 00:05:49,223
Just a moment.

99
00:05:51,263 --> 00:05:53,023
- Yes, Grandma. - Where are you?

100
00:05:54,033 --> 00:05:55,963
I'm at a friend's house. Why?

101
00:05:56,463 --> 00:05:57,563
Your brother's here.

102
00:05:57,863 --> 00:06:00,373
Cut your day short and come home to make dinner.

103
00:06:00,673 --> 00:06:01,673
Right now?

104
00:06:01,973 --> 00:06:03,573
Yes, now. When else?

105
00:06:05,503 --> 00:06:07,013
Okay. I'll be there soon.

106
00:06:10,183 --> 00:06:11,843
What is it? Is something wrong at home?

107
00:06:12,813 --> 00:06:14,853
I think I should get going.

108
00:06:15,413 --> 00:06:16,783
You have fun.

109
00:06:17,983 --> 00:06:18,983
Ko Eun Seol, hey.

110
00:06:31,333 --> 00:06:32,533
Hop on. I'll give you a ride home.

111
00:06:33,533 --> 00:06:35,203
It's okay. I can take the bus.

112
00:06:35,633 --> 00:06:36,633
You're just my excuse.

113
00:06:37,803 --> 00:06:39,573
Truth is, I can't stand parties like this.

114
00:06:39,643 --> 00:06:40,643
Hop on already.

115
00:06:46,483 --> 00:06:48,253
You really don't listen, do you?

116
00:06:49,783 --> 00:06:50,783
Hop on.

117
00:06:55,853 --> 00:06:56,923
Didn't you hear me?

118
00:07:08,903 --> 00:07:10,343
- Mom. - Eun Seol,

119
00:07:10,343 --> 00:07:12,143
why are you already back from your friend's?

120
00:07:12,273 --> 00:07:14,743
Grandma said Eun Guk was home.

121
00:07:16,443 --> 00:07:18,343
So she told you to make dinner?

122
00:07:19,613 --> 00:07:20,853
I can't believe her.

123
00:07:21,283 --> 00:07:24,483
I'll handle his dinner, so go have fun.

124
00:07:24,723 --> 00:07:25,883
It's fine.

125
00:07:26,323 --> 00:07:27,823
What do you mean it's fine?

126
00:07:27,893 --> 00:07:29,693
You were so excited about going to the party.

127
00:07:30,563 --> 00:07:31,563
Mom, please.

128
00:07:36,933 --> 00:07:40,433
Who's this handsome young man? Is he your boyfriend?

129
00:07:41,433 --> 00:07:43,803
No. What do you mean, boyfriend?

130
00:07:46,073 --> 00:07:47,973
Hello, I'm Cha Seok Jin.

131
00:07:48,413 --> 00:07:50,313
I'm a senior at Eun Seol's school.

132
00:07:51,883 --> 00:07:55,553
You look very reliable. Have fun with Eun Seol.

133
00:07:55,983 --> 00:07:57,983
- I'm going inside now, okay? - Mom, wait.

134
00:07:58,053 --> 00:07:59,053
Bye.

135
00:08:01,623 --> 00:08:03,053
I should go in too.

136
00:08:03,523 --> 00:08:04,563
Wait.

137
00:08:22,673 --> 00:08:23,683
Sorry.

138
00:08:23,943 --> 00:08:25,713
Didn't you hear your mother?

139
00:08:26,143 --> 00:08:27,783
She told you to go have fun.

140
00:08:34,353 --> 00:08:35,653
So, let's do just that.

141
00:08:42,993 --> 00:08:44,363
I'm home.

142
00:08:45,833 --> 00:08:47,373
Why are you back so early?

143
00:08:47,773 --> 00:08:48,773
I heard Eun Guk was here,

144
00:08:48,773 --> 00:08:50,403
- so I wrapped things up early. - I see.

145
00:08:50,603 --> 00:08:53,673
Speaking of which, why are you home?

146
00:08:53,743 --> 00:08:55,213
I thought you were working part-time at a friend's shop.

147
00:08:55,273 --> 00:08:56,313
Don't even ask.

148
00:08:56,773 --> 00:08:58,913
Just because he owns the fried chicken place,

149
00:08:59,013 --> 00:09:00,853
he nags way too much.

150
00:09:02,413 --> 00:09:04,583
I wouldn't complain if he at least paid well.

151
00:09:04,823 --> 00:09:06,383
So you just left?

152
00:09:07,093 --> 00:09:08,093
Yes.

153
00:09:08,223 --> 00:09:09,893
I still got paid for half a day.

154
00:09:10,093 --> 00:09:11,163
Mom, one go.

155
00:09:11,423 --> 00:09:12,523
Honey.

156
00:09:12,993 --> 00:09:16,333
Just stop it. He must've had his reasons.

157
00:09:17,263 --> 00:09:18,303
Anyway...

158
00:09:18,363 --> 00:09:21,803
What's taking Eun Seol so long? She should've been home by now.

159
00:09:21,873 --> 00:09:23,403
I told her she could stay out longer.

160
00:09:23,673 --> 00:09:24,673
What?

161
00:09:24,803 --> 00:09:25,803
Why?

162
00:09:25,973 --> 00:09:27,143
What do you mean, why?

163
00:09:27,443 --> 00:09:30,013
You're here, and so am I. Why would we need Eun Seol too?

164
00:09:31,283 --> 00:09:32,513
You did the right thing, Mom.

165
00:09:33,143 --> 00:09:34,353
It's not like I'm some VIP.

166
00:09:34,413 --> 00:09:36,113
Why make her come back when she's out?

167
00:09:36,413 --> 00:09:38,483
She's not running errands. She's just out having fun.

168
00:09:38,723 --> 00:09:39,783
Besides,

169
00:09:39,783 --> 00:09:42,653
being the eldest grandson makes you a VIP.

170
00:09:43,393 --> 00:09:47,863
Anyway, the only girl in the house is no help at all.

171
00:09:47,933 --> 00:09:49,133
Mom, two go.

172
00:09:49,893 --> 00:09:53,033
You should all try to be more like Eun Seol.

173
00:09:53,133 --> 00:09:55,133
Just a minute. I'll get dinner ready for you.

174
00:09:56,073 --> 00:09:57,073
Take your time.

175
00:09:57,143 --> 00:09:58,903
I already ate at the training camp, so I can wait.

176
00:09:59,443 --> 00:10:02,773
So, how's training for nationals going?

177
00:10:03,013 --> 00:10:04,483
I'm working hard.

178
00:10:04,813 --> 00:10:07,083
Don't just work hard. You have to do well, you hear?

179
00:10:07,113 --> 00:10:09,913
Like who? Like your father. Now, watch this. Three go.

180
00:10:10,453 --> 00:10:11,453
All right.

181
00:10:12,953 --> 00:10:14,053
Let's go.

182
00:10:15,723 --> 00:10:17,593
You pooped!

183
00:10:20,463 --> 00:10:21,933
Hae Ra, congratulations on the Grand Prize.

184
00:10:21,933 --> 00:10:23,563
- Congratulations. - I knew you'd win.

185
00:10:23,633 --> 00:10:25,563
- You're amazing. - Hae Ra's the best.

186
00:10:25,863 --> 00:10:29,303
- Hae Ra, congratulations. - Hae Ra, congratulations.

187
00:10:29,373 --> 00:10:30,643
Congratulations, Hae Ra.

188
00:10:33,713 --> 00:10:36,543
Seriously? He's still not here?

189
00:10:46,253 --> 00:10:47,893
What are we doing back here?

190
00:10:48,193 --> 00:10:49,693
I thought you were excited about the party.

191
00:10:49,823 --> 00:10:52,093
But you said you hated parties.

192
00:10:53,263 --> 00:10:55,733
You can't always do what you want in life.

193
00:10:57,203 --> 00:10:58,203
Let's go in.

194
00:11:01,873 --> 00:11:03,703
Seok Jin, why aren't you here yet?

195
00:11:03,703 --> 00:11:04,873
I just arrived.

196
00:11:05,573 --> 00:11:06,573
Where are you?

197
00:11:07,713 --> 00:11:08,713
Here.

198
00:11:12,783 --> 00:11:14,683
(Grand Prize Winner: Congratulations, Kang Hae Ra)

199
00:11:14,753 --> 00:11:16,283
What took you so long?

200
00:11:16,353 --> 00:11:18,923
- I've been waiting forever. - Something came up.

201
00:11:19,423 --> 00:11:22,853
Sorry I'm late. You look really beautiful today.

202
00:11:23,923 --> 00:11:26,923
- Let's go say hi to my parents. - Okay, sure.

203
00:11:33,703 --> 00:11:35,973
Mom, Dad. Seok Jin's here.

204
00:11:36,273 --> 00:11:38,673
- Well, it's been a while. - Yes, sir.

205
00:11:38,673 --> 00:11:41,373
Seok Jin, you get more handsome every time I see you.

206
00:11:42,273 --> 00:11:43,843
Is your mother doing well?

207
00:11:44,383 --> 00:11:45,383
Yes.

208
00:11:46,083 --> 00:11:47,953
Is her health still the same?

209
00:11:49,053 --> 00:11:50,753
She's gotten a lot better.

210
00:11:51,353 --> 00:11:53,383
I heard you made the national rankings again.

211
00:11:54,593 --> 00:11:56,723
Thanks to your help, I'm studying hard.

212
00:11:56,953 --> 00:11:57,963
That's good to hear.

213
00:11:58,023 --> 00:11:59,623
That makes funding your scholarship all worth it.

214
00:12:00,693 --> 00:12:01,693
Thank you, sir.

215
00:12:24,283 --> 00:12:26,983
I don't think I've seen you before. Who are you?

216
00:12:28,323 --> 00:12:29,353
Hello.

217
00:12:29,423 --> 00:12:30,523
I'm Ko Eun Seol.

218
00:12:30,823 --> 00:12:33,793
- I'm Hae Ra's friend. - Hae Ra's friend?

219
00:12:40,773 --> 00:12:43,403
Yes. Is something wrong?

220
00:12:44,343 --> 00:12:45,743
Oh, it's nothing.

221
00:12:46,443 --> 00:12:48,743
It's just that I know most of Hae Ra's friends,

222
00:12:48,813 --> 00:12:50,343
and I've never seen you before.

223
00:12:52,543 --> 00:12:54,083
Well, have fun.

224
00:12:54,913 --> 00:12:55,913
Right.

225
00:12:59,423 --> 00:13:02,053
- I'm going to the restroom. - Okay. Go ahead.

226
00:13:04,393 --> 00:13:06,623
I'll look around and catch up with you later.

227
00:13:06,693 --> 00:13:08,793
Sure. Make yourself comfortable.

228
00:13:17,103 --> 00:13:18,143
Leaving already?

229
00:13:20,773 --> 00:13:22,873
I don't feel like I belong here.

230
00:13:23,413 --> 00:13:24,683
I'll be on my way.

231
00:13:24,683 --> 00:13:25,683
Wait.

232
00:13:27,013 --> 00:13:28,013
Then I'll go with you.

233
00:13:29,283 --> 00:13:30,283
Why?

234
00:13:31,053 --> 00:13:32,123
Well...

235
00:13:32,383 --> 00:13:34,323
I told you, I hate this kind of event.

236
00:13:41,733 --> 00:13:43,333
Seok Jin left?

237
00:13:43,663 --> 00:13:44,663
Yes.

238
00:13:44,833 --> 00:13:47,673
He seemed to follow your friend Ko Eun Seol out.

239
00:13:47,733 --> 00:13:48,733
What?

240
00:13:49,033 --> 00:13:52,173
How could you just let him leave? You should've stopped him!

241
00:13:55,213 --> 00:13:56,213
Seok Jin.

242
00:13:56,773 --> 00:13:57,913
Seok Jin!

243
00:14:04,583 --> 00:14:05,583
Ko Eun Seol!

244
00:14:08,253 --> 00:14:10,523
So you're determined to get on my nerves?

245
00:14:11,493 --> 00:14:13,463
You clearly don't know who I am.

246
00:14:22,233 --> 00:14:23,573
Why is this all torn up?

247
00:14:24,103 --> 00:14:25,273
Who did this?

248
00:14:25,873 --> 00:14:27,173
Is this some kind of warning?

249
00:14:38,353 --> 00:14:40,593
What? What do you mean?

250
00:14:40,753 --> 00:14:42,023
What did you see?

251
00:14:43,293 --> 00:14:45,563
I saw who did that to your painting.

252
00:14:46,523 --> 00:14:47,893
So, who was it?

253
00:14:49,133 --> 00:14:50,263
Well...

254
00:15:04,643 --> 00:15:07,483
Is that true? Kang Hae Ra did it?

255
00:15:08,253 --> 00:15:11,983
I have perfect vision. It was definitely Kang Hae Ra.

256
00:15:19,993 --> 00:15:21,733
- Choi Soo Jung. - What?

257
00:15:21,733 --> 00:15:22,963
Can we talk for a second?

258
00:15:23,233 --> 00:15:24,233
Me?

259
00:15:31,943 --> 00:15:34,713
What's so important you had to summon me?

260
00:15:36,743 --> 00:15:37,913
I heard you did it.

261
00:15:38,743 --> 00:15:41,453
Make some sense. What exactly did I do?

262
00:15:41,853 --> 00:15:43,083
My painting.

263
00:15:43,313 --> 00:15:44,623
Aren't you the one who slashed it?

264
00:15:44,723 --> 00:15:46,553
Who says I did that?

265
00:15:47,223 --> 00:15:48,253
Do you have proof?

266
00:15:49,853 --> 00:15:51,063
Someone saw you.

267
00:15:51,163 --> 00:15:52,263
Who saw me?

268
00:15:54,563 --> 00:15:55,593
Choi Soo Jung.

269
00:15:56,233 --> 00:15:58,833
She definitely saw you do it, Kang Hae Ra.

270
00:16:06,273 --> 00:16:07,273
(Choi Soo Jung)

271
00:16:12,613 --> 00:16:13,613
Hello?

272
00:16:14,083 --> 00:16:16,453
Choi Soo Jung. It's Hae Ra.

273
00:16:17,153 --> 00:16:18,623
Did you tell someone you saw me?

274
00:16:20,853 --> 00:16:21,853
Right.

275
00:16:22,493 --> 00:16:23,693
Hold on.

276
00:16:26,563 --> 00:16:27,833
Why don't you ask her yourself?

277
00:16:31,463 --> 00:16:32,833
Soo Jung, it's me.

278
00:16:33,363 --> 00:16:36,273
Didn't you clearly say you saw Kang Hae Ra do it?

279
00:16:37,773 --> 00:16:39,403
No, when did I ever say that?

280
00:16:40,103 --> 00:16:41,373
What?

281
00:16:41,473 --> 00:16:44,743
You said you had perfect vision and that you saw it clearly.

282
00:16:45,043 --> 00:16:46,843
I never said anything like that.

283
00:16:47,853 --> 00:16:49,083
I'm hanging up.

284
00:16:49,483 --> 00:16:52,783
Hey, Soo Jung. Choi Soo Jung!

285
00:16:56,423 --> 00:16:58,593
What's wrong? Did she deny saying that?

286
00:17:00,663 --> 00:17:03,033
So why would you accuse someone like that?

287
00:17:03,333 --> 00:17:04,503
It's upsetting.

288
00:17:05,863 --> 00:17:07,263
Be more careful from now on.

289
00:17:09,773 --> 00:17:10,843
Oh, right.

290
00:17:11,603 --> 00:17:13,603
Are you interested in Seok Jin by any chance...

291
00:17:13,673 --> 00:17:14,773
when he's out of your league?

292
00:17:16,313 --> 00:17:18,743
Too bad, though. Seok Jin belongs to me.

293
00:17:20,713 --> 00:17:21,853
Remember this.

294
00:17:22,183 --> 00:17:24,553
I can't stand anyone touching what's mine.

295
00:17:48,743 --> 00:17:49,813
Are you okay?

296
00:17:50,643 --> 00:17:51,643
About what?

297
00:17:53,643 --> 00:17:54,953
I heard what happened.

298
00:17:55,783 --> 00:17:57,683
We'll soon know who did it.

299
00:17:57,683 --> 00:18:00,893
I asked the teachers to find whoever did this.

300
00:18:01,323 --> 00:18:02,453
Why would you do that?

301
00:18:03,453 --> 00:18:05,363
- What? - Why bother with this...

302
00:18:05,363 --> 00:18:06,863
when it's none of your business?

303
00:18:07,993 --> 00:18:09,133
Ko Eun Seol.

304
00:18:10,193 --> 00:18:11,603
Could you please leave now?

305
00:18:11,833 --> 00:18:13,603
I need to get ready for the next competition.

306
00:18:14,173 --> 00:18:15,203
Sure.

307
00:18:27,343 --> 00:18:29,353
You want me to get you another painting?

308
00:18:29,513 --> 00:18:31,453
You know this is a bigger competition, right?

309
00:18:31,623 --> 00:18:33,053
Tell the artist to work hard on it.

310
00:18:34,793 --> 00:18:37,923
Actually, maybe it's better if you skip this competition.

311
00:18:38,693 --> 00:18:41,463
The artist said they won't do anything like that again.

312
00:18:41,933 --> 00:18:44,663
Didn't I tell you? Artists are a dime a dozen.

313
00:18:45,063 --> 00:18:46,363
Find someone else.

314
00:18:47,533 --> 00:18:50,743
Kang Hae Ra. Could you try thinking for once?

315
00:18:51,573 --> 00:18:54,273
If you want to pass it off as yours, the style has to match.

316
00:18:54,643 --> 00:18:56,743
Don't you know that's a huge red flag?

317
00:18:57,943 --> 00:18:59,243
Are you saying you can't do it?

318
00:19:04,153 --> 00:19:07,223
Then solve it with money. Just say we'll pay double.

319
00:19:10,393 --> 00:19:11,793
Hae Ra, please don't.

320
00:19:13,263 --> 00:19:14,763
What are you solving with money?

321
00:19:16,033 --> 00:19:17,033
Dad.

322
00:19:18,363 --> 00:19:19,533
What is it, Manager Joo?

323
00:19:20,363 --> 00:19:22,903
We were just talking about her tutor.

324
00:19:23,403 --> 00:19:25,073
There's someone with great reviews,

325
00:19:25,073 --> 00:19:28,073
and we're trying to hire them even though we'd have to pay more.

326
00:19:29,073 --> 00:19:30,543
Is what she said true?

327
00:19:30,713 --> 00:19:32,513
You never liked having a tutor.

328
00:19:32,513 --> 00:19:34,283
That was back then.

329
00:19:34,383 --> 00:19:36,713
I'm a high schooler now, so I have to study hard.

330
00:19:38,083 --> 00:19:39,883
Dad, you really don't trust me?

331
00:19:40,153 --> 00:19:42,693
How many times have you let me down?

332
00:19:43,393 --> 00:19:44,823
Never forget that you're...

333
00:19:44,993 --> 00:19:46,393
the daughter of Cheongma Group.

334
00:19:49,763 --> 00:19:53,203
Cheongma this, Cheongma that. I'm so sick of it!

335
00:19:54,333 --> 00:19:55,533
Keep it down.

336
00:20:05,913 --> 00:20:08,513
- Hey, Mom. - Why aren't you home?

337
00:20:08,753 --> 00:20:10,153
I'm at school. Why?

338
00:20:13,153 --> 00:20:14,653
I didn't realise how late it was.

339
00:20:14,753 --> 00:20:17,023
Okay, I'll be right there. Got it.

340
00:20:30,803 --> 00:20:31,803
Eun Seol.

341
00:20:32,873 --> 00:20:34,543
- Mom. - Here, let me carry your bag.

342
00:20:34,613 --> 00:20:37,513
- It's okay. - At least let me take this.

343
00:20:37,583 --> 00:20:39,213
You're impossible.

344
00:20:41,083 --> 00:20:42,583
Do you enjoy painting?

345
00:20:43,253 --> 00:20:44,253
Yes.

346
00:20:45,783 --> 00:20:48,253
So you want to go to art school?

347
00:20:48,693 --> 00:20:50,053
Could you afford to send me?

348
00:20:53,263 --> 00:20:56,433
If you want to go, then of course I'll send you.

349
00:20:57,393 --> 00:21:00,933
It's okay. I know you're already stretched thin supporting Eun Guk.

350
00:21:01,933 --> 00:21:03,403
I can just paint as a hobby.

351
00:21:06,273 --> 00:21:08,373
There's no need to look at me like that.

352
00:21:09,713 --> 00:21:11,313
I feel bad, that's all.

353
00:21:12,043 --> 00:21:15,413
I'm a parent who can't even properly support her own child.

354
00:21:16,053 --> 00:21:18,583
You have nothing to be sorry for.

355
00:21:19,123 --> 00:21:20,323
Someone told me...

356
00:21:20,583 --> 00:21:22,553
you can't just do what you love in life.

357
00:21:23,753 --> 00:21:25,023
Who told you that?

358
00:21:26,393 --> 00:21:27,393
Just someone.

359
00:21:28,893 --> 00:21:30,093
Anyway, Mom,

360
00:21:30,193 --> 00:21:32,263
I'm hungry. Is there anything to eat at home?

361
00:21:33,403 --> 00:21:36,273
As a matter of fact, I made your favourite, tteokbokki.

362
00:21:36,603 --> 00:21:37,743
Sounds delicious.

363
00:22:02,033 --> 00:22:03,433
How can I help you?

364
00:22:04,433 --> 00:22:06,263
I have a painting here for Joo Mi Ran.

365
00:22:07,873 --> 00:22:09,273
(Artwork Delivery and Condition Report)

366
00:22:14,713 --> 00:22:16,243
What are you solving with money?

367
00:22:17,413 --> 00:22:18,443
Dad.

368
00:22:19,713 --> 00:22:20,913
What is it, Manager Joo?

369
00:22:21,713 --> 00:22:24,283
We were just talking about her tutor.

370
00:22:24,823 --> 00:22:26,383
There's someone with great reviews,

371
00:22:26,523 --> 00:22:29,453
and we're trying to hire them even though we'd have to pay more.

372
00:22:32,763 --> 00:22:34,163
You're home, sir.

373
00:22:34,293 --> 00:22:36,363
Ms. Kim went to a meeting.

374
00:22:39,363 --> 00:22:40,563
What's this?

375
00:22:42,033 --> 00:22:43,033
Sorry?

376
00:22:43,473 --> 00:22:46,243
It was addressed to you. Tell me what it is.

377
00:22:46,273 --> 00:22:47,503
Dad, you're home.

378
00:22:47,943 --> 00:22:49,673
Answer me right now.

379
00:22:50,643 --> 00:22:51,643
Sir.

380
00:22:52,013 --> 00:22:55,453
Dad, what's wrong? Did Ms. Joo do something wrong?

381
00:22:57,113 --> 00:22:58,483
Did you ask her to do this?

382
00:22:58,823 --> 00:23:00,783
To hire someone to paint for you?

383
00:23:01,293 --> 00:23:02,953
That's not it, Dad.

384
00:23:03,853 --> 00:23:04,923
Sir.

385
00:23:05,393 --> 00:23:08,663
I was wrong. Please forgive me just this once.

386
00:23:10,263 --> 00:23:13,433
Ms. Joo, have you lost your mind?

387
00:23:13,563 --> 00:23:16,803
Even if she threw a fit, you shouldn't have agreed to this.

388
00:23:17,333 --> 00:23:18,903
If word of this ever got out,

389
00:23:18,973 --> 00:23:21,043
can't you imagine how it would damage the company?

390
00:23:21,143 --> 00:23:23,413
How is anyone going to find out?

391
00:23:23,543 --> 00:23:25,613
Dad, you worry too much.

392
00:23:25,813 --> 00:23:27,043
Kang Hae Ra!

393
00:23:30,483 --> 00:23:33,223
You're forbidden from entering any more art competitions.

394
00:23:33,483 --> 00:23:35,623
- Understand? - Dad!

395
00:23:37,323 --> 00:23:38,463
Darn it.

396
00:23:44,463 --> 00:23:46,103
You're not entering the competition?

397
00:23:46,663 --> 00:23:48,773
I wasn't really feeling it this time.

398
00:23:49,233 --> 00:23:51,803
Then it looks like our school's only representative...

399
00:23:52,203 --> 00:23:53,573
will be Ko Eun Seol.

400
00:23:54,473 --> 00:23:57,613
Eun Seol, I'm counting on you.

401
00:23:57,613 --> 00:24:00,413
Your latest piece is just as good, so just focus on finishing up.

402
00:24:00,583 --> 00:24:02,213
If you do, you'll get good results.

403
00:24:02,553 --> 00:24:03,753
Yes, ma'am.

404
00:24:32,783 --> 00:24:35,483
Then it looks like our school's only representative...

405
00:24:35,483 --> 00:24:36,653
will be Ko Eun Seol.

406
00:24:36,753 --> 00:24:39,383
Your latest piece is just as good, so just focus on finishing up.

407
00:24:39,383 --> 00:24:41,423
If you do, you'll get good results.

408
00:24:42,053 --> 00:24:43,953
- Got it? - Yes, ma'am.

409
00:25:04,483 --> 00:25:05,483
What the...

410
00:25:57,733 --> 00:25:59,433
I wanted to apologise for last time.

411
00:25:59,463 --> 00:26:01,773
Can you meet me at the convenience store by the school?

412
00:26:01,773 --> 00:26:02,933
I'll be waiting.

413
00:26:04,373 --> 00:26:05,743
Well, that was random.

414
00:26:44,143 --> 00:26:47,043
If I can't enter the competition, neither can you.

415
00:26:47,883 --> 00:26:49,213
That's the only way it's fair.

416
00:27:06,103 --> 00:27:08,603
Three, two, one.

417
00:27:09,373 --> 00:27:11,443
All right, time to dig in.

418
00:27:18,313 --> 00:27:19,313
Nice.

419
00:27:33,393 --> 00:27:34,393
Ko Eun Seol?

420
00:27:51,683 --> 00:27:53,243
Hae Ra, I'm at the convenience store.

421
00:27:53,243 --> 00:27:54,313
Where are you?

422
00:27:54,853 --> 00:27:55,913
Sorry,

423
00:27:55,913 --> 00:27:58,123
my mom caught me on my way out, so I couldn't make it.

424
00:27:58,853 --> 00:27:59,883
I'll see you tomorrow.

425
00:28:02,293 --> 00:28:04,393
Hey, Hae Ra. Kang Hae Ra!

426
00:28:09,693 --> 00:28:11,063
Unbelievable.

427
00:28:41,463 --> 00:28:42,463
Boo!

428
00:28:43,993 --> 00:28:45,063
Ko Eun Seol, what are you doing here?

429
00:28:46,663 --> 00:28:48,603
Don't tell me you've been painting this late.

430
00:28:49,373 --> 00:28:51,233
I have a deadline coming up soon.

431
00:28:56,443 --> 00:28:58,013
Have you eaten yet?

432
00:28:58,683 --> 00:28:59,813
Can I get you something? My treat.

433
00:29:00,483 --> 00:29:02,213
Why would you? No, I'm good.

434
00:29:02,653 --> 00:29:03,653
Did I...

435
00:29:04,723 --> 00:29:06,123
Did I do something wrong?

436
00:29:08,623 --> 00:29:11,663
It feels like you're avoiding me, so I was wondering if I upset you.

437
00:29:12,563 --> 00:29:13,663
It's not like that.

438
00:29:13,923 --> 00:29:15,033
Then why are you acting like this?

439
00:29:16,163 --> 00:29:17,163
What do you mean?

440
00:29:17,793 --> 00:29:18,863
I should get going.

441
00:29:19,603 --> 00:29:20,963
Ko Eun Seol. Hey...

442
00:29:27,573 --> 00:29:29,743
I can't believe she gave me the runaround.

443
00:29:34,783 --> 00:29:37,753
Wait. My painting.

444
00:30:19,693 --> 00:30:23,593
(A Trap Called Desire)

445
00:30:23,763 --> 00:30:25,433
So what's going to happen to Ko Eun Seol now?

446
00:30:25,563 --> 00:30:27,263
She'll probably get expelled and her life will be over.

447
00:30:27,463 --> 00:30:29,773
I guess we'll find out the truth from the CCTV footage.

448
00:30:29,873 --> 00:30:30,873
The CCTV footage?

449
00:30:31,373 --> 00:30:35,513
It's me. Find one of her weaknesses. If she doesn't have any, create one.

450
00:30:36,073 --> 00:30:38,443
Are you interested in me by any chance?

451
00:30:38,813 --> 00:30:40,283
Because I'm interested in you.

452
00:30:40,913 --> 00:30:44,253
She's nothing but trouble for this family.

453
00:30:44,783 --> 00:30:46,853
Don't you know things went downhill after she was born?

454
00:30:47,053 --> 00:30:50,123
Is there a family member who's able to donate blood?

455
00:30:50,523 --> 00:30:51,623
Mom...

456
00:30:52,563 --> 00:30:54,123
Am I not your daughter?
